{"id":"86a742fad2207b40","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-derivation.md","title":"Derivation","display":"df-derivation — Derivation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-derivation","aliases":["88-df-derivation"],"display":"df-derivation — Derivation","depends_on":["[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivation — Derivation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (candidate theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (candidate finite sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> (candidate formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\\)</span> (derivation-sequence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Derivation}_{T,R}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Derivation}_{T,R}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (derivability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\nd:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\Bigl[\nd(i)\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad{}\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_m)\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}^m\\;\\bigl(\n((d(j_1),\\ldots,d(j_m)),d(i))\\in R\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\nd:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\Bigl[\nd(i)\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad{}\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_m)\\in\\{0,\\ldots,i-1\\}^m\\;\\bigl(\n((d(j_1),\\ldots,d(j_m)),d(i))\\in R\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivation}_{T,R}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land\\exists d\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\n\\land d(n)=\\varphi\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivation}_{T,R}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land\\exists d\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\n\\land d(n)=\\varphi\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Derivation}\">\\(\\mathrm{Derivation}\\)</span> : 推导（从公理和假设出发，通过推理规则得到结论的公式序列, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_1, \\ldots, \\psi_n\">\\(\\psi_1, \\ldots, \\psi_n\\)</span> : 推导序列（有穷, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推导是形式证明的具体实现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推导展示了证明的完整过程</li>\n<li>推导是可检查、可验证的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivSeq}\\)</span>保留实际有限证明对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Derivation}\">\\(\\mathrm{Derivation}\\)</span>仅断言存在\n以指定公式收尾的该对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推导类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公理推导：从公理出发</li>\n<li>假设推导：从假设出发</li>\n<li>自然推导：使用自然演绎规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子：证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p \\land q) \\rightarrow p\">\\((p \\land q) \\rightarrow p\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\land q\">\\(p \\land q\\)</span>（假设）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>（从1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>-消去）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p \\land q) \\rightarrow p\">\\((p \\land q) \\rightarrow p\\)</span>（从1-2，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rightarrow\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)</span>-引入）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a>：推导存在的结果</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>：推导发生的系统</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b906e83ff9b25155\" href=\"?note=b906e83ff9b25155\" title=\"88-df-logical-consequence\">88-df-logical-consequence</a>：推导的语义对应</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (candidate theory, see [[88-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi$ (candidate formula, see [[88-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inf